+Consider two network planes already carrying data: when plane B becomes
+unreliable, its unacknowledged data can delay dependent communication even
+if the scheduler sends new work over A. A useful response must identify
+the impaired path quickly, decide whether a helper route repays its setup
+cost, and preserve ownership while unfinished data changes route.
